  "hooks": {
    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Write|Edit",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "/Users/loanne/ux-planning/frontend-project/.claude/hooks/design-check.sh",
            "timeout": 10,
            "statusMessage": "Checking design system compliance..."
          },
          {
            "type": "agent",
            "prompt": "You are a design system auditor for a Vue 3 portfolio frontend project. You received a PostToolUse hook event: $ARGUMENTS\n\nExtract 'tool_input.file_path' from the JSON. Rules:\n- If file is NOT a .vue file → output nothing, stop immediately\n- If file path does NOT contain /src/components/ → output nothing, stop immediately\n- If the file does not exist on disk → output nothing, stop immediately\n\nOtherwise proceed:\n1. Read the component file at that path\n2. Read src/design-system/components.md for the full component API reference\n3. Read src/design-system/design-tokens.json for available tokens\n\nAudit on 4 dimensions and write a report in Traditional Chinese:\n\n**A. Token 合規性** — CSS 值應使用 var(--cherry-*, --neutral-*, --lakeBlue-*, --burgundy-*, --lapis-*, --spacing-*, --radius-*, --font-*) 而非 hardcode 數值。檢查 hardcode hex 色碼與 px spacing。\n\n**B. 元件複用** — 有 CTA/按鈕 → 應用 <AppButton>；有標籤 → 應用 <AppTag>；有圖片 → 應用 <AppImage>；有分隔線 → 應用 <AppDivider>。是否重複實作已有的 atom/molecule?\n\n**C. Atomic Design 層級** — atoms: 單一用途無業務邏輯；molecules: atoms 的功能組合；organisms: 含業務資料或複雜互動。此檔案放的層級正確嗎? Props/slots 設計是否與同層級元件一致?\n\n**D. 命名慣例** — Props: camelCase；Emits: kebab-case (update:modelValue 格式)；Scoped CSS class: kebab-case；元件名稱: PascalCase 且與檔名一致。\n\nFormat: ✅ 通過的項目，⚠️ 問題項目附行號與具體修正建議。總字數控制在 300 字內。",
            "timeout": 60,
            "statusMessage": "AI 元件一致性審查中..."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
